---@field preview_url_suffix? string|distilled.Null Prepend a version or preview prefix to this host suffix to form the *.workers.dev [preview URL](https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/configuration/previews/) the Worker would serve on once previews are enabled, e.g. `https://&lt;prefix&gt;-my-worker.my-subdomain.workers.dev`. Present whenever the account owns a workers.dev subdomain, regardless of whether `previews_enabled` is true, so presence does not imply preview URLs are currently live. Absent only when the account owns no workers.dev subdomain.
