---@class cloudflare.workers.BetaWorkersVersionsProfileRequest
---@field account_id string Identifier.
---@field worker_id string Identifies the Worker by ID or name.
---@field version_id string Identifies the version by UUID or UUID prefix with a minimum length of eight characters. Use "latest" to select the most recently created version, which may not be deployed. Use "latest-deployed" to profile a version in the active deployment. Versions are tried in order of traffic share until one has a loaded isolate.
---@field duration_ms number Profile duration in milliseconds.
---@field actor_id? string Identifies the exact Durable Object actor to profile. Must be specified together with namespace_id. The actor must currently be active and running the requested version.
---@field namespace_id? string Identifies the Durable Object namespace containing the actor to profile. Must be specified together with actor_id.
---@field profile_type? cloudflare.workers.BetaWorkersVersionsProfileRequestProfileType|string

---@alias cloudflare.workers.BetaWorkersVersionsProfileRequestProfileType "cpu"|"heap"

---@class cloudflare.workers.BetaWorkersVersionsProfileResponse

