---@field version_tags? cloudflare.workers.ScriptsSecretsBulkUpdateRequestVersionTagsMap Optional version tags to apply to the new script version.

---@class cloudflare.workers.CodeUpdateStrategy
---@field mode cloudflare.workers.CodeUpdateStrategyMode|string `immediate` applies Durable Object code updates right away; `deferred` lets active Durable Objects hibernate before updating their code.
---@field max_delay? number Maximum number of seconds (0-86400, millisecond precision) to wait before forcing the update. Only valid with mode `deferred`. When omitted, the default maximum delay (300) applies.

---@alias cloudflare.workers.CodeUpdateStrategyMode "immediate"|"deferred"

