---@field sampleInterval number Average sample interval of the matched events. Each stored event has a sample interval of 1 / (the sampling rate applied when it was ingested): the Worker's head_sampling_rate multiplied by any platform sampling applied to the account or script. A value of 1 means none of the matched events were sampled. A value above 1 means count and value are estimated from sampled data, not exact. This is independent of statistics.abr_level.
---@field value number Result of the calculation. count, sum, avg, median, and percentiles are weighted by each event's sample interval
